===Etymology 1===
Anglicization of {{bor|en|cy|Ifan}}, ultimately from {{der|en|la|Jōhannēs}}, variant of {{m|la|Iōannēs}}, from {{der|en|grc-koi|Ἰωάννης}}, from {{der|en|he|יוֹחָנָן|tr=yōḥānān, yokhanán|lit=[[God]] is [[gracious]]}}. {{doublet|en|Giovanni|Ian|Ivan|Jack|Jean|Johan|Johann|Johannes|John|Sean|Shane|Shaun|Shawn}}.

